==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|la:lumen|-escence}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌluː.məˈnɛs.əns/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Back ache-luminescence.wav}}
* {{hyphenation|en|lu|min|es|cence}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛsəns|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} Any [[emission]] of [[light]] that cannot be attributed merely to the [[temperature]] of the emitting body.

